<title>DUBAI: United Arab Emirates Q2 M3 rises 3.7 pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>United Arab Emirates Q2 M3 rises 3.7 pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates' broadly defined M3 money supply rose 3.7 percent in the second quarter of 1996 over the previous quarter, UAE Central Bank figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage change over three months):</p>
<p>		 Q2 1996		 Q1 1996</p>
<p> M3	    +3.7		    -2.7</p>
<p> M2	    +6.0		    -2.8</p>
<p> M1	    +3.6		    +4.0</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (in millions of dirhams)</p>
<p>		 Q2 1996		 Q1 1996</p>
<p> M3	    104,378		 100,681</p>
<p> M2	     83,851		  79,097</p>
<p> M1	     22,428		  21,652</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
</text>
